Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

 Global keys
  1-7                    switch tabs: Sessions, Graph, Quotas, Messages, Tools,
                         Settings, Inbox
  enter                  go into the selected thing
  arrows, j/k            move
  esc                    back; first clears a filter you typed
  /                      filter or search
  R                      refresh
  c                      open the CTO session
  C                      focus the CTO box
  ?                      help
  q, ctrl+c              quit

 Sessions
  pgup/pgdn              page
  home/g, end            first, last row
  enter                  go into the selected session on NAME, or open the
                         delegation policy on DELEGATE
  m                      send a message to the session as yourself
  n                      start a session in herdr: project, harness, model,
  more below
up/down scroll  esc close help  q quit
